ixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15472\r\n\r\nThis creates a shortcut to copy the selected node(s)' `@onready` annotation(s) to clipboard for use in an external editor, mimicking the behavior of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/60708. The main code is largely the same as in that PR, just simplified to only use the scene root path as there's no script context to draw from unlike in the editor case.\r\n\r\nThe shortcut will be visible only if the setting `text_editor/external/use_external_editor` is `true`.\r\n\r\nNo AI was used.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n\r\nI simplified the code from the drag & drop PR to here, but not 100% certain how unique names should resolve so there might be a logic error there.","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-09-03T07:57:16Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T08:03:06Z","closed_at":"2026-09-03T08:02:25Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"75b0f088c03c4dcecf7dba4970b4673d3b0b472f","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"he